{"title":"CSS: Downloads","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>These downloads are not needed but can be helpful to learn about a CSS.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Google_Chrome\">Google Chrome</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_Downloads&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Google Chrome\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Google Chrome is a browser that reads a CSS better than IE 8.\n</p><p>1. Go <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.google.com/chrome?hl=en&amp;brand=CHMI/\">here</a> to download google chrome\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"CSS_Scan\">CSS Scan</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_Downloads&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: CSS Scan\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>CSS Scan is used to list all of the elements of a CSS in a web site. CSS scan is a Google Chrome plug in.\n</p><p>1. Go <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://chrome.google.com/webstore/detail/nnklpgoldelpoigiacfpnpphpkkmbdkb?hl=en-US/\">here</a> to download CSS Scan\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_Downloads&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS_Tutorial\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"CSS Tutorial\">Previous: Tutorial</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CSS:_Basics\" title=\"CSS: Basics\">Next: Basics</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018075413\nCache expiry: 86400\nRed